     2544           delete object v-tth no-error.
     2545           run adm/shattri.p (
     2546              input "get":U
     2547             ,input buf_trn-doc.obj-type
     2548             ,input buf_trn-doc.obj-code
     2549             ,input 'inv-obj':U
     2550             ,input  "izlcstpr"
