     2764             for each orig_marking-lines no-lock where orig_marking-lines.gds-code   = buf_goods.gds-code
     2765                                                   and orig_marking-lines.obj-type   = archive_parts.obj-type
     2766                                                   and orig_marking-lines.obj-code   = archive_parts.obj-code
